<title>USA: American General to set competitive offering.</title>
<headline>American General to set competitive offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American General Corp is expected to issue $500 million in capital securities via a 144A competive offering Tuesday morning, syndicate sources said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a 49-year noncallable maturity and is slated to price at 1100 EST/1600 GMT, sources said.</p>
<p>(( Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
